{
 "template": "identity_face_full",
 "version": 1,
 "task": "identity",
 "description": "InstantID full-body variant: identical to identity_face, plus a SEPARATE keypoint image (image_kps) - a canvas with the reference face placed small and high, which frees the composition for a whole standing figure. Measured trade (2026-08-25, this machine): face 0.109 of frame at ArcFace likeness 0.596 (in the same-person band) vs 0.184 / 0.77 without the canvas; anchoring the face below ~0.08 of frame drops likeness out of the band (0.075 -> 0.461). The pipeline builds the canvas from the persona's own reference.",
